  "created": "2026-10-08T19:43:10.573Z",
  "description": "Opt-in installable apps for Orleans.Lattice: embedded JSON manifests declaring an app's trees, roles, replication intent, change-feed subscriptions and MCP tools, validated without loading app code; a durable app registry of install records with group-only role bindings and a version-pinned capability ceiling; an activation pipeline, re-run for every enabled app after silo start, that compiles roles into ordinary authorization rules, provisions exclusively owned a/{app}/{tree} trees through the ownership ledger backing the core ITreeOwnershipGuard, and enrols declared replication per install; and a change-feed subscription runtime that delivers committed user writes to the handlers registered for an app's subscriptions. Registered with AddLatticeApps(), with apps shipped in the silo image added through AddLatticeApp(...).",
  "id": "Orleans.Lattice.Apps",
